``LintModuleTest.runTest`` takes the ``golden_master`` fixture of pytest-remaster, now
installed with ``pylint[testutils]``. The expected ``.txt`` output then becomes a golden
master: ``pytest --remaster`` rewrites the outdated files, except a file written for an
older Python version, which also applies to later versions. Without the fixture,
``runTest`` compares the output as before.

Refs #10953
